Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Claire Rogers work for?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 13, "text": "Claire Rogers"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 15, "end": 106, "text": "Claire Rogers is a researcher who has made significant contributions to her field of study."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 107, "end": 262, "text": "One notable aspect of her career is her association with Curtin University, a prominent institution of higher learning located in Perth, Western Australia."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 263, "end": 290, "text": "Career at Curtin University"}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 292, "end": 410, "text": "Claire Rogers worked as a researcher at Curtin University, where she was involved in various projects and initiatives."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 411, "end": 569, "text": "According to her profile on ResearchGate, a social networking site for scientists and researchers, Rogers listed Curtin University as one of her affiliations."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 570, "end": 677, "text": "[1] This suggests that she was actively engaged with the university's research community during her tenure."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 678, "end": 813, "text": "Furthermore, a search of Curtin University's staff directory archives reveals that Claire Rogers was indeed employed by the university."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 814, "end": 961, "text": "Although the exact dates of her employment are not publicly available, her presence in the directory confirms her association with the institution."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 962, "end": 965, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 967, "end": 1131, "text": "Rogers' research focus and expertise align with Curtin University's strengths in various fields, including science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM)."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1132, "end": 1252, "text": "Her work has likely contributed to the university's reputation as a hub for innovative research and academic excellence."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1253, "end": 1264, "text": "References:"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1266, "end": 1283, "text": "[1] ResearchGate."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1284, "end": 1291, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1292, "end": 1306, "text": "Claire Rogers."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1307, "end": 1378, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.researchgate.net\\/profile\\/Claire_Rogers>"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1380, "end": 1402, "text": "[2] Curtin University."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1403, "end": 1410, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1411, "end": 1427, "text": "Staff Directory."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 205, "text": "As Claire Rogers navigated the labyrinthine corridors of the BGI Genomics headquarters in Shenzhen, the soft hum of sequencers and the gentle chatter of her colleagues created a soothing background melody."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 206, "end": 373, "text": "It was a typical Wednesday morning, with the aroma of freshly brewed coffee wafting from the break room, enticing her to grab a cup before diving into the day's tasks."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 374, "end": 515, "text": "Claire, a renowned geneticist, had been with BGI for nearly five years, and the company's cutting-edge facilities 