med at mapping the genetic diversity of the world's populations, had been her brainchild. BGI's resources and expertise had been the perfect catalyst to bring her vision to life. Claire's gaze drifted to the framed photograph on her desk, showing her alongside BGI's charismatic CEO, Wang Jian, at the project's launch ceremony.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Curtin University", "BGI Genomics"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Curtin University", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "BGI Genomics", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
